---
// "Text them" beat: a specialist doing non-coding work.
---

<div
  class="tg-card tg"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Telegram chat with marko, a marketing specialist: you ask for three hooks for the launch post, marko replies with a numbered list and recommends the second."
>
  <div class="tg-head" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="tg-ava a2">m</span>
    <span class="who"><b>marko</b><span>bot</span></span>
    <span class="dots">⋮</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tg-body" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="msg out">
      <p>marko, three hooks for the launch post</p>
      <span class="meta">9:14 <span class="ticks">✓✓</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="msg in" style="max-width:92%">
      <span class="name">marko</span>
      <ul>
        <li>"Your subscription is a team now."</li>
        <li>"An agent that asks first is a teammate."</li>
        <li>"Great at your desk. You're not always at your desk."</li>
      </ul>
      <p><b>The second one</b> — it's your wedge, and it fits your voice from the last three posts.</p>
      <span class="meta">9:15</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
